I: This is the TLI interview autopsy. Subject zero five seven activity previously.
S: Described.
I: Here's your first photo. And your time begins now.
S: Alright in this photo I see a man and a woman. The woman appears to be intrigued by the man's face. Whereas the man seems to be intrigued by something off in the distance. The man's eyes widen. Maybe he's crazy. Maybe he's in love with the woman. Maybe she's in love with the man. Or maybe he just has some lunch on his upper lip. We don't know though. The woman's hair seems to be kept up. She spent some time on that in the morning. Maybe she used gel or a fine mousse. We don't know for sure. It appears she's wearing lots of makeup. Although the black and white photo does not give us all the evidence to support that. The man appears to be not wearing any makeup although his hair seems to be very finely kept. He's got a little point coming down off the top there in the front coming out right into the middle of his forehead. His shirt.
I: So you said she looked like she may be in love with him.
S: Mhm.
I: What about the photo gave you that impression.
S: Her eyes. She seems to be kind of calmer entranced by something about his face there. She's she all her attention is on him. And none of his is on hers.
I: Perfect alright. Here's your second photo. And your time begins now.
S: In this photo I see what appears to be a woman standing on a bridge leaning over looking at what appears to be some water below. The sun seems to be at a let's say a a four o'clock position overhead. Because it is not directly above her. It is somewhat behind her casting a a full luminous light across the land. There seems to be a man in charge of three other people in the background. He's standing in a very authoritative position. Whereas the other people are holding what appear to be heavy bags. Maybe seeds or dirt or manure. But they are by a river where there is a boat beside them. Maybe they're unloading a boat and carrying them towards what appears to be a big factory or mill behind them. Which wouldn't really make sense beside this bridge and the lake where this lady is looking off.
I: Time perfect no. Follow up questions.
S: Nothing else to say.
I: Here's your third and final photo. And your time begins no.
S: Alright in this photo it appears to be maybe a family on a farm. There's three people and a horse. Two women. One appears to be maybe pregnant and leaning against a tree. Or maybe she's just old and taking a break. Whereas the other lady is standing front to the left holding two books. Maybe she's off to school. Maybe gonna start a business. Bring some money into the farm later on. The man in the back is shirtless and appears to be pretty jacked besides this tall beautiful white horse maybe doing some farm work. In the background I can see another figure with another horse. Maybe it's a day or some workers out in the field plowing some seeds. There's a barn and some mountains in the background. Maybe this is in Europe somewhere. We don't know. The ground in the front seems to be rocky.
I: There's a minute. You said the the woman in the foreground she looks like she's either on her way to school or maybe a future business person.
S: Mhm.
I: Can you explain why that she got you that impression?
S: She's dressed nicely. She looks well-kept. And she's carrying books and walking away like her back's turned to the farm and family potentially or workers. So it seems like she's different from them.
I: Alright perfect I have no follow up questions. Thank you.
